The IFC, measured CSV files, source RDF, excerpts and data-derived material
retain source attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 terms. They are not relabelled MIT.
Transformations include exact CSV import to SQLite, Unix-time conversion to
UTC, extraction of source IFC geometry, explicit room/GlobalId alignment,
documented setpoint-namespace normalisation, bounded source-row display
sampling and a chronological temperature-forecasting experiment. Raw supplied
source files are unchanged. Transformations and hashes are documented in the
source manifest, audit and application reports.

